#: ../../source/docs/solo_battery_calibration.rst:5
#: e7a7bfaaeae6419b82a98c79ff710494
msgid "3DR Solo - Smart Battery Calibration"
msgstr "3DR Solo - 智能电池校准"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_battery_calibration.rst:7
#: 6c47f494ff5c404c97cd6d937afcc5a5
msgid ""
"The Solo Smart Battery may need recalibration from time to time.  The "
"following write up details how execute a recalibration of the BMS."
msgstr "Solo 智能电池可能需要不时进行重新校准。以下内容详细说明了如何对 BMS 执行重新校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_battery_calibration.rst:10
#: 4cf33b0f99ac4a14b78689349605ffb2
msgid ""
"Gently discharge the battery pack until it cuts off the first time (this is "
"around 12V)."
msgstr "轻柔放电直至电池组第一次切断电源（此时电压约为 12V）。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_battery_calibration.rst:11
#: 1a191e1b611947cb8f222329b18ed2e5
msgid ""
"Allow the pack the relax for at least 5 hours.  The pack's voltage will "
"climb above 12V during this process.  **DO NOT TRY TO DISCHARGE THE PACK "
"AGAIN.**  Damage to the battery may result."
msgstr "让电池组静置至少 5 小时。在此过程中，电池组电压将回升至 12V 以上。**请勿再次尝试放电。** 否则可能损坏电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_battery_calibration.rst:12
#: dee8ab4d257640fea97048cf47fd675a
msgid ""
"Charge the pack completely and leave it on the charger for 48 hours.  The "
"pack will relax, then do a balance cycle, then top off."
msgstr "将电池组完全充满电，并在充电器上保持 48 小时。电池组将先静置，然后进行均衡充电，最后补满电量。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_battery_calibration.rst:13
#: 4b532690b4a94765827b6450f2059ca7
msgid ""
"Let the pack sit for at least 2 hours off the charger before using the pack."
msgstr "从充电器上取下电池组后，至少静置 2 小时再使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_battery_calibration.rst:15
#: 16d823df1a724e6b8f3653435834150e
msgid ""
"This tutorial was written by the Solo EE team (Jeff Wurzbach and Philip "
"Rowse)."
msgstr "本教程由 Solo 电气工程团队（Jeff Wurzbach 和 Philip Rowse）编写。"
